Clashero (the foundation of the clash engine)
  engine/ started as a copy of the clash/ crate of Clashero, taken from
  commit a1616b3 (2026-03-29). Derived from it, and changed by us since:
  engine/Cargo.toml; engine/src/ifc_adapter.rs, selector.rs,
  bcf_reporter.rs, clash_engine.rs, lib.rs, main.rs; engine/tests/
  bcf_reporter_tests.rs, clash_detect_tests.rs, clash_engine_tests.rs,
  cli_tests.rs, test_ifc_adapter.rs, viewpoint_tests.rs,
  test_clash_set.json; and the test models in engine/tests/models/
  AC20-FZK-Haus.ifc, Building-Architecture.ifc, Building-Hvac.ifc,
  Building-Structural.ifc (these carry their own terms, see below).
  Also informed by Clashero, not copied line by line: the discipline →
  IFC type tables behind presets/*.json, the filename discipline
  heuristic in packages/clash-core/src/discipline.ts, and the MCP tool
  set in packages/mcp-server/ (dashboard tools left out).
